    "font" : "Helvetica",
    "font size" : 9.96,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "IBM Storwize V7000 can use SNMP traps, syslog messages, and Call Home email to notify you and the IBM Support Center when significant events are detected. Any combination of these notification methods can be used simultaneously."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 39,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 135.0, 408.667, 539.667, 460.667 ],
    "font" : "Helvetica",
    "font size" : 9.96,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Notifications are normally sent immediately after an event is raised. However, events can occur because of service actions that are performed. If a recommended service action is active, notifications about these events are sent only if the events are still unfixed when the service action completes."
  }, {
    "type" : "heading",
    "pdfua_tag" : "H1",
